  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.01",
    "order": 192,
    "anchor": "15.01",
    "summary": "Each Stratagem lists its price, timing, eligible targets, effect and any extra restrictions. Core Stratagems are open to both players; Codexes and other releases supply more.\n\nA player may reuse a Stratagem across the battle, but each player:\n\n- uses the same Stratagem at most once per phase\n- aims only 1 Stratagem at a given unit per phase, unless a rule overrides that cap\n\nTo use one:\n\n1. Choose the targets.\n2. Deduct the price from your CP pool (see [Gain Core CP](vsdata:core-rule/gain-core-cp)); without enough CP you cannot use it. A section priced separately, for example at +1 CP, applies only if you pay that extra.\n3. Apply the effect.",
